author: the project author
time: the project generate time,the format is "Y-M-D H:M:S"
idx: the unique project id, get from the time.time()
material: the project material detail
    name: the name of the material
    permittivity: the permittivity of the material
    permeability: the permeability of the material
    dielectric_loss_tangent: the dielectric_loss_tangent of the material
sub: the project substrate detail
    material: the material name that the substrate use
    h: the substrate height
range_freq: the setup freq range
points: the total solution points from single freq range
range_angle: the angle range

build stuff:
    var is to set the project variable
    CreateCs = create_coordinate_system
    SetWorkCs = set_working_coordinate_system
        When the content is "LastCreateCs",the input should be the return from the last CreateCs
    CreateRec/rectangle = create_rectangle
    Rotate = rotate
    Unite = unite
    DupAxis = duplicate_around_axis
    Curve = create_equationbased_curve
    Line = create_polyline
    Cover = cover_lines


